    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to introduce 5 Maplewood Close to the market. This attractive three-bedroom mid-terrace home is presented in good condition throughout and offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers looking to take their first step onto the property ladder. Ready for immediate occupation, the property is offered to the market with no onward chain and provides a comfortable home with scope for its new owners to add their own personal style over time.\n\nThe accommodation is bright and well laid out, with a generous living room to the front opening through double doors into the kitchen/dining room to the rear. Upstairs are three good-sized bedrooms and a family bathroom. Outside, the low-maintenance rear garden enjoys a westerly aspect, while the front of the property provides off-street parking and a lawned area.\n\nIdeally positioned within the popular and close-knit Springfield estate in Dublin 24, No. 5 is within walking distance of The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Hospital and a wide range of local schools, shops, pubs and restaurants. The area is well served by public transport, with the LUAS and Dublin Bus both readily accessible, while the N7, N81 and M50 are all within easy reach, providing convenient connections to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. With its established location, practical accommodation and scope to evolve with its new owners, 5 Maplewood Close is sure to appeal to first-time buyers seeking a home they can enjoy from day one."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 3.95m x 1.70m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.30m x 3.30m\n\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 3.52m x 5.10m\n\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.30m x 2.73m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.55m x 3.27m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.78m x 2.27m\n\n\nShower Room - 1.74m x 2.47m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 3 bedroom family in excellent condition, offering 80 sqm (approx.) living accommodation</li><li> GFCH with new gas boiler (approx 3 years old)</li><li> Generous rear garden with westerly aspect</li><li> Double glazed throughout</li><li> Quiet cul de sac</li><li> Highly sought after location</li><li> Off street parking</li><li> Close to all amenities and transport links</li><li> Scope to convert and extend (subject to planning permission)</ul>"
      },
